---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { experience, personalEntries } from '../data/portfolio';
---
<Base title="About" description="A computer science and finance background, a direction toward product ownership, and a few interests outside work.">
  <header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">A little more context</p><h1>Hi, I’m Aryan.</h1><p>I’ve explored product, finance, and consulting. The work I keep coming back to puts me close to users and engineers, with room to build, measure, and improve.</p></header>
  <section class="about-story"><h2>The route here</h2><div><p>I studied Computer Science with a Finance minor at BITS Pilani, Hyderabad. Alongside college, working with startups through the consulting group gave me an early view of product design, go-to-market decisions, and customer needs.</p><p>JPMorgan made the importance of accuracy and trust in financial systems concrete. MoveInSync gave me broader ownership across customers, product and analytics. Consulting added a different perspective, but reinforced how much I value staying with a product after the recommendation.</p><p>I’m focused on product management and technical PM roles, with a particular interest in financial systems. I’m also exploring analytical opportunities in markets and risk.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section" id="experience"><div class="section-head"><h2>Experience, in context</h2></div><div class="about-jobs">{experience.map(job => <article><div><h3>{job.company}</h3><p class="work-type">{job.dates}</p></div><div><p class="job-role">{job.role}</p><p>{job.detail}</p>{job.href && <a class="read-link" href={job.href}>Selected work <Icon /></a>}</div></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="section credentials"><h2>Education & credentials</h2><div><h3>BITS Pilani, Hyderabad Campus</h3><p>B.E. Computer Science · Minor in Finance · 2020–2024</p><p>Overall CGPA 8.52/10 · Finance minor GPA 9.67/10</p><ul><li>CFA Program: Level II cleared</li><li>FRM exams: Parts I and II cleared</li><li>Bloomberg Market Concepts</li></ul></div></section>
  <section class="section" id="outside"><div class="section-head"><h2>Outside work</h2></div><div class="interests-grid"><article><p class="eyebrow">Anime</p><h3>Dragon Ball Z, always.</h3><p>My favourite. I also like the psychological tension of Monster and Psycho-Pass season one, the adventure of Frieren, and the sci-fi of Cowboy Bebop and Neon Genesis Evangelion.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Formula 1</p><h3>Max and Red Bull.</h3><p>I follow the racing, but also the decisions around it: development rules, how the whole car comes together, and how teams think about their drivers.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Macro & geopolitics</p><h3>From big shifts to prices.</h3><p>Oil, chip supply, DRAM and SSDs—and what those changes mean for everyday technology. I’m interested in where the expectation of better, cheaper tech meets supply constraints.</p></article></div>{personalEntries.length > 0 && <div class="personal-entries">{personalEntries.map(entry => <article><p class="work-type">{entry.kind}</p><h3><a href={entry.href}>{entry.title} <Icon name="external" /></a></h3><p>{entry.description}</p></article>)}</div>}</section>
  <p class="closing-note">I’ve also helped build communities, published with others, and taught finance and economics. <a href="/work/#community">Those entries are in the work index.</a></p>
</Base>
